    "title": "Iraq’s prime minister seeks big energy investments on US trip",
    "description": "BAGHDAD: Iraq’s new prime minister, Ali Al-Zaidi, aims to secure major US investment in his country’s oil, gas, and power sectors during a visit to the White House this week, after ​the Iran war hammered crude output and state finances. Iraq’s government is increasingly focused on diversifying international partnerships to better cope with regional instability, analysts say,",
